end="1:52.997">能</span></p><p begin="1:53.007" end="1:56.874" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.007" end="1:54.896">在不完整的马拉松里</span><span begin="1:54.896" end="1:56.125">也只有时间获</span><span begin="1:56.125" end="1:56.874">胜</span></p><p begin="1:56.944" end="1:59.798" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:56.944" end="1:57.492">一半</span><span begin="1:57.492" end="1:58.143">包扎</span> <span begin="1:58.143" end="1:59.120">一半被留下</span><span begin="1:59.120" end="1:59.798">伤疤</span></p><p begin="1:59.808" end="2:03.569" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1000"><span begin="1:59.808" end="2:01.328">一半在冷言相对</span> <span begin="2:01.328" end="2:02.606">另一半在不断</span><span begin="2:02.606" end="2:02.984">讲</span><span begin="2:02.984" end="2:03.569">话</span></p><p begin="2:04.081" end="2:07.087" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.081" end="2:06.464">我知道这些矛盾都是爱在</span><span begin="2:06.464" end="2:06.833">拱</span><span begin="2:06.833" end="2:07.087">火</span></p><p begin="2:07.097" end="2:11.820" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:07.097" end="2:08.654">我想要找到平衡</span> <span begin="2:08.654" end="2:10.079">于是对着麦克风</span><span begin="2:10.079" end="2:11.820">说</span></p></div><div begin="2:10.719" end="2:24.082" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2:10.719" end="2:11.057" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:10.719" end="2:11.057">Mary</span></p><p begin="2:11.067" end="2:12.086" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.067" end="2:11.603">我知道你</span><span begin="2:11.603" end="2:12.086">在</span></p><p begin="2:12.306" end="2:13.770" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.306" end="2:12.894">我已经习</span><span begin="2:12.894" end="2:13.346">惯了平</span><span begin="2:13.346" end="2:13.770">淡</span></p><p begin="2:14.029" end="2:15.552" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.029" end="2:15.067">我感受不到你的</span><span begin="2:15.067" end="2:15.341">脉</span><span begin="2:15.341" end="2:15.552">络</s